title: 'It held: Libby, tending Ed''s graph after this dream on 2026-11-15, moved none of the dream''s notes.'
pid: 779504f4-e803-4bf2-9354-cb1854cfa354
body: |2-
  Each sat under "what I know" or beside it, behind a link whose words
  say what it holds. Ed's graph was not young: "what I know" already
  held two readings behind links, the place this dream wrote into. One
  case, and of a graph that had its places, so it says nothing yet of
  a newborn's first dream.
